  "articleBody": "Adding a bathroom can improve daily function and expand usable living space, but the right plan depends on available square footage, plumbing access, ventilation, electrical capacity, structural conditions, and local approvals. Before hiring a contractor, define the bathroom’s purpose, confirm where utilities can connect, compare layout options, and request a written scope covering design, permits, construction, finishes, and inspections.",
